WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
This plant has no mouth.

2
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.670
You eat food to get energy,
but a plant never eats a thing.

3
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.990
Yet it keeps growing, leaf after leaf.

4
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.110
So where does its food come from?

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.590
Does it suck food up from
the soil, through its roots?

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.630
In this mission, you'll
look inside a leaf,

7
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.510
right down to the tiny green
parts inside its cells.

8
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.050
You'll see why a leaf is
broad, flat and thin.

9
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.190
You'll learn the word
equation for photosynthesis.

10
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.090
And you'll find out what
makes a plant work faster,

11
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.470
and what slows it down.

12
00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.330
Your mission: find out where
a plant's food comes from.
